Third-party attribution
=======================

The skills under `plugins/` are derived from Superpowers, an agentic skills
framework by Jesse Vincent (obra), used here as a toy example of a skill set
worth measuring.

    Superpowers — https://github.com/obra/superpowers
    Licensed under the MIT License.

They have been modified for this demo: the plugins were renamed to the
`tessleng/sdlc-*` set, the plan-output path convention was genericised, and
references to the upstream project name were removed from prose. The skill
instructions themselves are substantially the upstream content.

Everything else in this repository — the `linkbox` toy codebase under
`scenarios/repo/`, the eval scenarios and their rubrics, the arms files, the
scripts, and the documentation — is original and covered by the LICENSE file
in this directory.
